WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.590
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:13.570
Last time: fair AI needs many kinds of examples

3
00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:20.140
Chapter 2 · AI and Privacy

4
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:30.990
Pri · va · cy. What does it mean?

5
00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:38.060
Meet Aarav, stuck on his science homework

6
00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:47.500
An AI homework helper on Mum's tablet

7
00:00:47.500 --> 00:01:02.870
"I'm Aarav Sharma. I live at 12 Lotus Lane…"

8
00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:12.840
Does the helper need all that? Think!

9
00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:24.100
It only needs his question!

10
00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:30.580
Keeping your things safe = PRIVACY

11
00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:37.180
Share personal things only with people you trust

12
00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:51.440
Name · School · Address · Phone · Photos

13
00:01:51.440 --> 00:02:03.880
Samosa uncle needs your order, not your address

14
00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:15.290
"Explain how plants make food" → perfect!

15
00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:27.670
Apps can save what you type. Think first!

16
00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:32.130
Extra-careful info: three kinds

17
00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:41.160
1 · Your real full name and your school

18
00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:51.560
2 · Home address and live location

19
00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:59.960
3 · Photos of home, house number, school badge

20
00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:06.520
Name + address can lead someone to your home

21
00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:14.420
Detective game: Aarav's new cycle photo

22
00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:24.570
What gives away private info? Spot it!

23
00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:35.340
House number · Street sign · School badge

24
00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:44.230
Ask a parent before sharing photos

25
00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:49.900
Game: Share or don't share?

26
00:03:49.900 --> 00:04:07.230
Which ones are okay to share?

27
00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:23.110
Share fun stuff. Keep private stuff private!

28
00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:32.270
AI helpers can sound super friendly

29
00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:43.240
It's a program, not a secret-keeping friend

30
00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:51.080
Friendly doesn't mean safe!

31
00:04:51.080 --> 00:05:00.830
Settings = switches for what apps can see

32
00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:08.100
Parents can use settings to limit sharing

33
00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:21.170
Which is safer for a kids' game?

34
00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:33.200
Location: OFF is safer

35
00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:37.150
Your turn: practice check

36
00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:51.010
A drawing game wants your location. Now what?

37
00:05:51.010 --> 00:06:04.880
Say no, and ask a grown-up to check

38
00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:11.810
AI doesn't need your life story

39
00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:15.980
Keep name, location, home photos private

40
00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:19.070
Ask a parent before sharing photos

41
00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:22.420
Settings can limit what's shared

42
00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:30.040
Chapter 2 done!

43
00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:36.840
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
